# FILE: .config/mise/.env.local.template
#
# DESCRIPTION:
# Template for `.config/mise/.env.local`, the machine-local override file mise loads
# last (see the `_.file` list in .config/mise/config.toml).
# Copy it to `.env.local`, fill in your own values, and never commit the result:
# `.env.local` is gitignored, and the Lefthook plaintext-secrets guard rejects it.
#
# SCOPE: non-secret values only. These two IDs are account-identifying rather than
# secret, which is why they are redacted from the public tree but kept in plaintext
# here. Credentials (API tokens, OAuth client secrets) go in the encrypted, equally
# untracked `.env.sops.yaml` instead - see `.env.yaml.template`.
#
# Look both values up in the Cloudflare dashboard (Overview pane) or via the API.
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""
CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=""
